# AnnPocketDb :: ci/lsan.supp
#
# LeakSanitizer suppressions (paired with ASan, detect_leaks=1). Same policy
# as tsan.supp: stay empty unless a specific, investigated, third-party leak
# needs silencing. A leak reported inside annpocketdb_kernel or
# annpocketdb_features is a real bug -- most likely a missing release on an
# error path (e.g. a page buffer allocated before a mid-function CHECK/return
# that skips its own cleanup). Fix it there; don't suppress it here.
#
# Example of the only kind of entry that belongs in this file:
# leak:libfontconfig.so

# (intentionally empty)
